  for improving the quality of reports of parallel‐group randomized trials 2001", "abstract": "To comprehend the        
  result of a randomized controlled trial (RCT), readers must understand its design, conduct, analysis and              
  interpretation. That goal can be achieved only through complete transparency from authors. Despite several decades    
